# Gut (shamanic rite) tiles for side-scrolling scenes, 16x16: straw mat,
# paper-lattice walls, posts and beam, the altar, candles, incense, shaman-god
# painting, five-direction flags, paper money, cloth strips, drum, gong, blade
# trestle, spirit pole, soul boat, the long white cloth, knotted cloth.
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 16 16
@output ../tiles/tiles_gut.png
@preview ../previews/tiles_gut_x4.png 4
@columns 8

